## Standards Structure

Universal standards are in `.claude/rules/` (always loaded by Claude Code):
- `security-baseline.md` - OWASP, auth, encryption
- `code-standards.md` - Language/style, naming, error handling
- `testing-standards.md` - Coverage, patterns, commands

Domain-specific standards are in subdirectory `CLAUDE.md` files:
- `[api-dir]/CLAUDE.md` - REST conventions, validation
- `[db-dir]/CLAUDE.md` - Query standards, migrations
- `[frontend-dir]/CLAUDE.md` - Component library, WCAG

The ISC2-certified Staff SWE persona is loaded automatically via the agent-orch plugin.
